---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../config";
---

<Base
  titel="About"
  beschrijving="Who is behind this, what is proven, and where the limits are."
  taal="en"
  lees
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p class="lead">{SITE.persoon.naam} — market access and compliance adviser.</p>

  <h2>Background</h2>
  <p>
    I built integrated quality, safety and environmental management systems for
    small and mid-sized companies, as an adviser with a client portfolio. Every
    client taken through to external certification passed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before that, the technical and regulatory side of industrial projects —
    where contracted measurement accuracy determines what two parties pay each
    other — and application and licence management in healthcare, where
    demonstrable control over access and contracts is the substance rather than
    the paperwork.
  </p>
  <p>
    I am studying business administration at the Open Universiteit, and I
    intend to study law after that.
  </p>

  <h2>Where the limits are</h2>
  <p>
    I do not provide reserved legal services. Where a question runs into that,
    I say so and refer on. I also do not promise a certificate: the
    certification body issues that, not me. What I deliver is the preparation
    that gets you through it.
  </p>

  <h2>How I work</h2>
  <p>
    First establish where you are being ruled out, and whether that is a gate
    or a score. A gate opens with a document you will have in six months; a
    score is won with a better offer. That difference decides what happens
    next, and whether it is worth doing.
  </p>

  <p><a class="knop" href="/en/contact/">Request a conversation</a></p>
</Base>
